Construct a ConstructionImpact draft with its actual domain fields. Only supported values enter `values`; preserve conflicts, missing fields and evidence bindings. Trace design, procurement, trade interfaces, and schedule dependencies using exact project graphs. Judge which dependencies are materially affected, distinguish potential from confirmed delay, and identify evidence needed to support commercial or timing claims.
